<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-OLAINFARM JUMPS, UNIBANKA SLIPS AT BOURSE FIX.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-OLAINFARM JUMPS, UNIBANKA SLIPS AT BOURSE FIX.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceuticals group Olainfarm</p>
<p>leapt after its first-half profit was announced while Unibanka</p>
<p>slipped at the morning share price fix.</p>
